chunks.text:
[Intro]
{a male Gregorian choir in unison, slow plainchant, stone cathedral reverb, no drums}
Con-fi-te-or...
{the choir holds one low note under everything that follows. A tired young man speaks over it, close to the microphone, slowly, every word clearly}
I wrote... tests.
{the choir answers, chanted}
Be honest.
{the young man, hesitating, clearly}
Okay. I RAN it. Once.
{the choir, lower}
Be honest.
{the young man, quietly}
I pushed it straight to prod.
{a calm, intimate female voice, very close, almost a whisper; then a reverse cymbal swell into the beat}
Thank you.
